You comforted her and made an urgent decision: crying will not solve this crisis, we must act immediately!
Sahil, Aashutosh, Kripal's mother, and you are now rushing straight to Pansemal Police Station to file an emergency FIR and mobilize the search team!
Will the authorities believe the tale of an invisible demonic shadow?!"
